                <object label="&lt;p&gt;Instructions on correct inhalation technique:&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ol&gt; &lt;li&gt;- Shake the salbutamol drug for min. 20 seconds&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;- Attach it to the spacer tube and place the mask over the child's month and nose. If the child crys you can still continue.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;- Give 1 puff into the spacer&amp;nbsp;and then let the child breathe in and out through the spacer at least 5 times (15-30seconds).&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;- Then give the next puff and let the child breathe again 5 times&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;- Repeat procedure 5 times.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ol&gt;" odk_type="help-message" id="s83G0JEc_5YMZ59fY2hO-81">
